# Microsoft Store — generated from store/microsoft/listing.json + CHANGELOG.md.
# Both are version-stamped, so a committed copy is stale the moment the version
# bumps. Regenerate on demand: `npm run store:manual` / `npm run store:metadata`.
store/microsoft/partner-center.md
store/microsoft/metadata.json

# Sibling checkouts that live inside this one.
#
# `khayt-cloud` and `khayt-website` are separate repositories, and `Khayt/` is an
# old copy of this one. Being untracked was not protection: a `git add -A` stages
# all three as gitlinks — a one-line entry that looks harmless in a diff and
# commits a pointer to a commit nobody else can resolve. That has now been caught
# once at review, which is once more than it should take.
#
# They are also why the local suite disagrees with CI: tests that scan the repo
# find three extra copies of everything here and none of them on a CI runner.
/Khayt/
/khayt-cloud/
/khayt-website/
/Khayt-Social-Launch-Kit.pdf
ios/**/*.xcworkspace/contents.xcworkspacedata

# Swift Package Manager build output (note the dot: the `build/` rule above does not match it)
.build/
*.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
DerivedData/
.ds-sync/
ds-bundle/
.design-sync/.cache/
.design-sync/learnings/
.design-sync/node_modules
design-system/node_modules/
design-system/dist/
